      "title": "🗡️ Zelda: Ocarina of Time remake is 2026's best-selling physical game in the US",
      "tags": [
        "Switch 2"
      ],
      "body": "Circana's Mat Piscatella says the Switch 2 remake took the year's physical crown after just one week, and it's the first game to pass one million physical units in a US launch week since Tears of the Kingdom. Worldwide it sold about 5.2 million in four days. GTA VI's code-in-box retail copies count as physical in Circana's data, so the crown could still change hands.",
